 "title": "New Mexico Reservoir Hits Low",
 "cat": "geography",
 "emoji": "💧",
 "sentences": [
  "New Mexico's largest reservoir hit 1.4 percent capacity!",
  "Extreme drought and early snowmelt drove Elephant Butte Reservoir to its lowest level since 1971.",
  "The low water exposed shoreline debris and covered boat ramps in sediment.",
  "Irrigation water helps farmers grow alfalfa, cotton, and Hatch green chiles.",
  "Water releases stopped after July 28, allowing the lake to slowly refill."
